Verification/view.png
Editor/EditorTools/ParametricSketcher/Panel/Verification/view.png

# SolidArc proof renders are regenerated deterministically by the verification binaries (203 MB of PNG in the
# source-of-truth tree). They stay out of this repository by default; commit a new phase proof deliberately with
# `git add -f Editor/EditorTools/ParametricSketcher/Proofs/<Phase>.png`. See Proofs/README.md.
Editor/EditorTools/ParametricSketcher/Proofs/*.png
!Editor/EditorTools/ParametricSketcher/Proofs/Phase32z_*.png
!Editor/EditorTools/ParametricSketcher/Proofs/Phase34*_*.png
!Editor/EditorTools/ParametricSketcher/Proofs/ToyCar_[ABC]_*.png
!Editor/EditorTools/ParametricSketcher/Proofs/ToyCar_Hero.png
!Editor/EditorTools/ParametricSketcher/Proofs/Biplane_[ABC]_*.png
!Editor/EditorTools/ParametricSketcher/Proofs/Biplane_Hero.png
!Editor/EditorTools/ParametricSketcher/Proofs/Boat_[ABC]_*.png
!Editor/EditorTools/ParametricSketcher/Proofs/Boat_Hero.png
